{"id":"shtorm","lemma":"шторм","pos":"noun","rank":2489,"glosses":["storm"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ea/Ru-%D1%88%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BC.ogg/Ru-%D1%88%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BC.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"шторма","plural":"штормы"},"examples":[{"text":"Похоже, скоро будет шторм.","en":"It seems that there will be a storm soon.","words":[{"g":"it seems"},{"g":"soon"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"После шторма море было спокойно.","en":"After the storm, the sea was calm.","words":[{"g":"after"},null,{"g":"sea"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"calmly, quietly"}]},{"text":"В ту ночь был шторм.","en":"There was a storm that night.","words":[{"g":"in"},{"g":"the sound of a train…"},{"g":"night, nighttime"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Он вышел несмотря на шторм.","en":"He went out in spite of the storm.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/656017","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to exit, to go out","l":"выйти"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"in spite of, despite"]]},{"text":"Мы опоздали из-за шторма.","en":"We were late because of the storm.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to be late","l":"опоздать"},{"g":"from / out of"},{"g":"behind / for"},null]}]}